WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.168 --> 00:00:14.454
you not recognize your king?"

2
00:00:15.335 --> 00:00:17.797
A man pushed his face close to Mandy.

3
00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:21.280
"This is King Louis XIV!

4
00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.702
He is the greatest king in the world!"

5
00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:25.663
"Louis who?"

6
00:00:26.364 --> 00:00:27.825
Vinnie whispered to Mandy.

7
00:00:28.746 --> 00:00:31.388
She pinched his arm to make him keep quiet.

8
00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:35.234
"That's enough, my Duke," the king said.

9
00:00:35.254 --> 00:00:38.356
"The children will go to their work now."

10
00:00:39.377 --> 00:00:43.119
King Louis waved his hand and walked away very slowly.

11
00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:48.003
His followers moved as slow as snails too.

12
00:00:51.465 --> 00:00:54.347
Vinnie giggled and pointed to their pointy shoes.

13
00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:58.570
"No wonder they can't walk fast," he said.

14
00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:01.392
"Shh!" said Mandy.

15
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:05.642
The women wore long full skirts.

16
00:01:06.903 --> 00:01:10.286
The men wore wide lace neckties and long coats.

17
00:01:11.987 --> 00:01:15.310
Both the men and women wore big curly wigs.

18
00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:19.053
"Didn't you hear the king?

19
00:01:19.373 --> 00:01:20.434
Go to your work!"

20
00:01:21.215 --> 00:01:22.696
the gardener shouted again.

21
00:01:23.857 --> 00:01:26.959
His voice was back now that the king had moved on.

22
00:01:26.979 --> 00:01:32.644
"But, sir, we do not know where to go," said Mandy.

23
00:01:33.448 --> 00:01:36.689
"We uh we are new here."

24
00:01:38.189 --> 00:01:41.250
The old man sighed and pointed to the next building.

25
00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:44.851
"Go inside to the kitchen and ask for Mary!"

26
00:01:45.931 --> 00:01:47.152
The children thanked him.

27
00:01:48.012 --> 00:01:50.273
Vinnie and Mandy headed for the kitchen.

28
00:01:51.393 --> 00:01:53.173
But someone was watching them.

29
00:01:53.193 --> 00:01:57.674
"So we're in France.

30
00:01:57.995 --> 00:02:01.115
Then this place must be—," Mandy began.

31
00:02:03.744 --> 00:02:06.706
"Versailles!" A girl jumped out from behind some tomato plants.

32
00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:11.268
"Ahhh!" Vinnie and Mandy screamed.

33
00:02:11.288 --> 00:02:14.690
"Oh, I'm sorry!"

34
00:02:15.891 --> 00:02:16.891
the girl giggled.

35
00:02:17.452 --> 00:02:19.112
She was about Mandy's age.

36
00:02:19.132 --> 00:02:20.893
"I'm Helene."

37
00:02:21.454 --> 00:02:22.975
She pointed to the old man.

38
00:02:22.995 --> 00:02:25.316
"He is my father.

39
00:02:25.736 --> 00:02:28.117
He's the gardener of the king's kitchen garden."

40
00:02:30.659 --> 00:02:32.800
The children introduced themselves.

41
00:02:33.932 --> 00:02:35.513
"Do you work here at Versailles?"

42
00:02:36.133 --> 00:02:36.773
asked Vinnie.

43
00:02:37.693 --> 00:02:38.713
Helene nodded.

44
00:02:38.733 --> 00:02:41.374
"I was born here," she said.

45
00:02:41.394 --> 00:02:44.075
"My family lives here to serve the king."

46
00:02:44.095 --> 00:02:47.736
"What about school?"

47
00:02:48.376 --> 00:02:49.096
asked Mandy.

48
00:02:50.157 --> 00:02:51.737
Helene laughed loudly.

49
00:02:51.757 --> 00:02:55.138
"You're so funny, Mandy.

50
00:02:55.498 --> 00:02:56.759
I don't go to school.

51
00:02:58.359 --> 00:02:59.319
You are new here.

52
00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:00.840
Let me show you around."

53
00:03:02.192 --> 00:03:06.134
The children saw orange trees and more gardens along the way.

54
00:03:10.297 --> 00:03:11.537
many gardens are there?"

55
00:03:12.278 --> 00:03:13.038
asked Vinnie.

56
00:03:13.418 --> 00:03:15.419
He was already tired of walking.

57
00:03:15.439 --> 00:03:20.182
"Lots and lots," giggled Helene.

58
00:03:21.222 --> 00:03:23.884
"And we have over 1,300 fountains, 300 statues and vases, and "What?"

59
00:03:23.904 --> 00:03:24.864
Vinnie stared at her.

60
00:03:32.332 --> 00:03:35.154
"There are 1,300 fountains?"

61
00:03:35.935 --> 00:03:38.316
He was thinking of the fountain in the photo.

62
00:03:38.336 --> 00:03:42.379
"How will we ever find the right one to get us home?"

63
00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:44.420
he wondered to himself.

64
00:03:45.601 --> 00:03:47.723
Mandy was thinking of something else.

65
00:03:47.743 --> 00:03:52.006
"And all of this is for just one person?"

66
00:03:52.646 --> 00:03:53.226
she asked.

67
00:03:53.246 --> 00:03:56.649
"Yes, it's all for the king of France.

68
00:03:57.089 --> 00:03:58.870
He can have whatever he wants."

69
00:03:59.451 --> 00:04:00.912
Helene smiled again.

70
00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.881
"Where do your parents work at Versailles?"

71
00:04:03.901 --> 00:04:08.863
"Uh, well Vinnie thought quickly.

72
00:04:10.103 --> 00:04:13.385
He remembered that Dad went to buy something for the roof.

73
00:04:13.405 --> 00:04:16.146
"Our parents are working on the roof."

74
00:04:18.047 --> 00:04:20.548
Helene looked up at the top of the palace.

75
00:04:21.048 --> 00:04:22.148
She seemed puzzled.

76
00:04:22.168 --> 00:04:26.650
"Maybe we can look for them later," she said, shrugging.

77
00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:31.012
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other and smiled.
